Name: Dawn WebGPU Implementation
Short Name: dawn
URL: https://dawn.googlesource.com/dawn.git
Version: 0.20261022.0
Revision: chromium/7103
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Google's open-source C++ implementation of the WebGPU standard (`webgpu.h`) and the Tint
WGSL shader compiler. Provides native backends for Direct3D 12, Metal, Vulkan, and OpenGL ES.
Aligned in YOLO with `yolo-gpu` (`wgpu 30.0.1` + `naga 30.0.0`) and Skia Graphite.

Local Modifications:
Managed across `stable` (M156), `dev` (M157), and `canary` (M158) via `yolo cvm`.
